msgid ""
"The **Diagnoses / Pathologies** section lists the resident's pathologies, "
"coded according to **ICD-10** (International Classification of Diseases). "
"Each line links the resident to a pathology from the **catalog**."
msgstr ""
"La section **Diagnostics / Pathologies** liste les pathologies de "
"l'habitant, codées selon la **CIM-10** (classification internationale des "
"maladies). Chaque ligne relie l'habitant à une pathologie du **catalogue**."

