msgid "Clinically confirmed allergy (yes / no)"
msgstr "Allergie cliniquement confirmée (oui / non)"

#: ../../content/soins/dossier-medical.md:144
msgid "Date identified"
msgstr "Date d'identification"

#: ../../content/soins/dossier-medical.md:144
msgid "**Reaction**"
msgstr "**Réaction**"

#: ../../content/soins/dossier-medical.md:144
msgid "Description of the reaction"
msgstr "Description de la réaction"

#: ../../content/soins/dossier-medical.md:169
msgid "Drug allergens protect prescribing"
msgstr "Les allergènes médicamenteux protègent la prescription"

#: ../../content/soins/dossier-medical.md:172
msgid ""
"For a **drug allergen**, the severity drives the behavior when prescribing: "
"**Critical** **blocks** the prescription of the medication concerned; "
"**High**, **Medium** or **Low** shows a **warning**. **Food** and "
"**environmental** allergies are for documentation. See [Prescriptions and "
"medications](prescriptions.md)."
msgstr ""
"Pour un **allergène médicamenteux**, la sévérité pilote le comportement à la"
" prescription : **Critique** **bloque** la prescription du médicament "
"concerné ; **Élevé**, **Moyen** ou **Faible** affiche un **avertissement**. "
"Les allergies **alimentaires** et **environnementales** sont documentaires. "
"Voir [Prescriptions et médicaments](prescriptions.md)."

#: ../../content/soins/dossier-medical.md:179
msgid ""
"An **Additional Allergy Notes** field lets you record, in free text, the "
"allergies or remarks that are not in the structured list."
msgstr ""
"Un champ **Notes d'allergies complémentaires** permet de consigner en texte "
"libre les allergies ou remarques qui ne figurent pas dans la liste "
"structurée."

#: ../../content/soins/dossier-medical.md:182
msgid "Medical contacts"
msgstr "Les contacts médicaux"

#: ../../content/soins/dossier-medical.md:184
msgid ""
"The **Medical Contacts** section links the resident to their healthcare "
"providers:"
msgstr ""
"La section **Contacts médicaux** relie l'habitant à ses intervenants de "
"santé :"

#: ../../content/soins/dossier-medical.md:187
msgid "**Specialist Doctors** — one or more doctors (tags);"
msgstr "**Médecins spécialistes** — un ou plusieurs médecins (étiquettes) ;"

#: ../../content/soins/dossier-medical.md:188
msgid "Reference **Pharmacy**."
msgstr "**Pharmacie** de référence."

#: ../../content/soins/dossier-medical.md:190
msgid ""
"The **Attending Physician** (the resident's assigned doctor) is set instead "
"on the resident's general information. These contacts are reused elsewhere "
"in Resthome: in prescriptions, and in the electronic exchanges with the "
"health insurer, where the country has them."
msgstr ""
"Le champ **Médecin traitant** (le médecin attitré de l'habitant) se "
"renseigne, lui, dans les informations générales de l'habitant. Ces contacts "
"sont réutilisés ailleurs dans Resthome : dans les prescriptions et, là où le"
" pays en dispose, dans les échanges électroniques avec l'assureur santé."

#: ../../content/soins/dossier-medical.md:198
msgid ""
"The physicians' records carry their **INAMI Number**, used in the eHealth "
"exchanges. See [Care in Belgium](../belgique/soins.md)."
msgstr ""
"Les fiches des médecins portent leur **Numéro INAMI**, utilisé dans les "
"échanges eHealth. Voir [Les soins en Belgique](../belgique/soins.md)."

#: ../../content/soins/dossier-medical.md:202
msgid "Advance directives and DNR"
msgstr "Les directives anticipées et le DNR"

#: ../../content/soins/dossier-medical.md:204
msgid "The **Advance Directives** section records the resident's wishes:"
msgstr ""
"La section **Directives anticipées** consigne les volontés de l'habitant :"

#: ../../content/soins/dossier-medical.md:206
msgid ""
"**Has Advance Directive** (yes / no) — when ticked, a **content** field "
"appears to describe what it contains;"
msgstr ""
"**Directives anticipées** (oui / non) — lorsqu'elle est cochée, un champ "
"**contenu** apparaît pour en décrire la teneur ;"

#: ../../content/soins/dossier-medical.md:208
msgid "**DNR Order (Do Not Resuscitate)** — the do-not-resuscitate decision."
msgstr "**Ordre DNR (Ne pas réanimer)** — décision de non-réanimation."

#: ../../content/soins/dossier-medical.md:210
msgid "The DNR is flagged everywhere in Resthome"
msgstr "Le DNR est signalé partout dans Resthome"

#: ../../content/soins/dossier-medical.md:213
msgid ""
"As soon as **DNR Order (Do Not Resuscitate)** is ticked, Resthome makes it "
"visible to care staff:"
msgstr ""
"Dès que **Ordre DNR (Ne pas réanimer)** est coché, Resthome le rend visible "
"pour le personnel soignant :"

#: ../../content/soins/dossier-medical.md:216
msgid ""
"an **orange banner** \"DNR — Do Not Resuscitate\" at the top of the resident"
" record;"
msgstr ""
"un **bandeau orange** « DNR — Ne pas réanimer » en haut de la fiche de "
"l'habitant ;"

#: ../../content/soins/dossier-medical.md:218
msgid "a **DNR badge** on the **kanban** card and in the residents **list**;"
msgstr ""
"un **badge DNR** sur la carte **kanban** et dans la **liste** des habitants "
";"

#: ../../content/soins/dossier-medical.md:219
msgid "a **DNR filter** in the search, to find the residents concerned."
msgstr ""
"un **filtre DNR** dans la recherche, pour retrouver les habitants concernés."

#: ../../content/soins/dossier-medical.md:222
msgid ""
"![Life project tab showing the advance directives and the DNR "
"order](../assets/screenshots/soins/directives-anticipees.png)"
msgstr ""
"![Onglet Projet de vie : les directives anticipées et l'ordre "
"DNR](../assets/screenshots/soins/directives-anticipees.png)"

#: ../../content/soins/dossier-medical.md:222
msgid "Life project tab showing the advance directives and the DNR order"
msgstr "Onglet Projet de vie : les directives anticipées et l'ordre DNR"

#: ../../content/soins/dossier-medical.md:224
msgid "Medical notes"
msgstr "Notes médicales"

#: ../../content/soins/dossier-medical.md:226
msgid ""
"Finally, a free-text **Medical Notes** field lets you record any important "
"information that does not fit the structured sections."
msgstr ""
"Enfin, un champ **Notes médicales** en texte libre permet de consigner toute"
" information importante qui n'entre pas dans les rubriques structurées."

#: ../../content/soins/dossier-medical.md:229
msgid "Key points to remember"
msgstr "Points clés à retenir"

#: ../../content/soins/dossier-medical.md:231
msgid ""
"The medical record is the **Medical Information** tab of the resident "
"record; it is **reserved for care staff** and **logged** (GDPR)."
msgstr ""
"Le dossier médical est l'onglet **Informations médicales** de la fiche "
"habitant ; il est **réservé au personnel soignant** et **journalisé** "
"(RGPD)."

#: ../../content/soins/dossier-medical.md:233
msgid ""
"The **weight** comes from the **vital signs** (read-only) and the **BMI** is"
" calculated automatically from height and weight."
msgstr ""
"Le **poids** vient des **signes vitaux** (lecture seule) et l’**IMC** se "
"calcule automatiquement à partir de la taille et du poids."

#: ../../content/soins/dossier-medical.md:235
msgid ""
"The **dependency category** and the **active care plan** are shown there "
"read-only."
msgstr ""
"La **catégorie de dépendance** et le **plan de soins actif** s'y affichent "
"en lecture seule."

#: ../../content/soins/dossier-medical.md:237
msgid ""
"The **diagnoses** use **ICD-10**; **severity** and **status** (Active / "
"Resolved) are specific to the resident."
msgstr ""
"Les **diagnostics** utilisent la **CIM-10** ; **sévérité** et **statut** "
"(Actif / Résolu) sont propres à l'habitant."

#: ../../content/soins/dossier-medical.md:239
msgid ""
"**Drug allergens** protect prescribing: **Critical** blocks, the others "
"warn."
msgstr ""
"Les **allergènes médicamenteux** protègent la prescription : **Critique** "
"bloque, les autres avertissent."

#: ../../content/soins/dossier-medical.md:240
msgid ""
"The **DNR** triggers a **banner**, a **kanban/list badge** and a search "
"**filter**."
msgstr ""
"Le **DNR** déclenche un **bandeau**, un **badge kanban/liste** et un "
"**filtre** de recherche."

#: ../../content/soins/dossier-medical.md:243
msgid "Further reading"
msgstr "Pour aller plus loin"

#: ../../content/soins/dossier-medical.md:245
msgid ""
"[Prescriptions and medications](prescriptions.md) — allergies and "
"interactions when prescribing."
msgstr ""
"[Prescriptions et médicaments](prescriptions.md) — allergies et interactions"
" au moment de prescrire."

#: ../../content/soins/dossier-medical.md:246
msgid "[Care plans and vital signs](plans-de-soins.md)"
msgstr "[Plans de soins et signes vitaux](plans-de-soins.md)"

